# Laeticia's day at four times (dusk and night pinned, so her own clock loops them): watering the beds, sitting on the bench, warming herself
# at the fire at dusk, gone home at night; she shelters in the rain.
set unlock all
set season summer
place cottage @32,30 0
place planter @26,32 0
place planter @27,32 1
place campfire @30,35 0
place bench @27,29 1
set camera 29 31 1
set time 0.02
fast 66 actor laeticia water planter
shot shots/laeticia_water.png
set time 0.25
fast 100 actor laeticia sit
expect habitat ok
shot shots/laeticia_sit.png
set clock dusk
fast 100 actor laeticia warm campfire
shot shots/laeticia_warm.png
set clock night
fast 100 actor laeticia inside
expect bubble no
shot shots/laeticia_night.png
set clock auto
set time 0.25
fast 100 actor laeticia sit
set weather rain
fast 50 actor laeticia inside
set weather natural
fast 50 actor laeticia any
quit
